{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "06K2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$e : U \\to R$", "MATH_0004": "$i : R \\to R$", "MATH_0005": "$T$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$e: U(T) \\to R(T)$", "MATH_0008": "$x \\in U(T)$", "MATH_0009": "$x$", "MATH_0010": "$i: R(T) \\to R(T)$", "MATH_0011": "$a \\in U(T)$", "MATH_0012": "$a$", "MATH_0013": "$(U(T), R(T), s, t, c)$", "MATH_0014": "$s$", "MATH_0015": "$t$", "MATH_0016": "$c$", "MATH_0017": "$e$", "MATH_0018": "$i$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-identity-inverse}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:750daa1c0ecbbb6b1ce7e17a464f4afaa9946122b9abe746f9ce5fbf201c9383", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8eec853dd7c4ab084838b34e74a1991b76a2def3273a2d477cf12949974689ca", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a groupoid in functors on a category <MATH_0002>.\nThere are unique morphisms <MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> such that\nfor every object <MATH_0005> of <MATH_0006>, <MATH_0007> sends\n<MATH_0008> to the identity morphism on <MATH_0009> and <MATH_0010> sends\n<MATH_0011> to the inverse of <MATH_0012> in the groupoid category\n<MATH_0013>. We will sometimes refer to <MATH_0014>, <MATH_0015>, <MATH_0016>, <MATH_0017>,\nand <MATH_0018> as ``source'', ``target'', ``composition'', ``identity'', and\n``inverse''.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d61bd451b42be4154aa45fcf9d7422e0c3a3731460bb95274c8b0b5e9cba9dd8", "unit_id": "tag:06K5:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06K2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$(\\underline{U}, \\underline{R}, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$R$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$R \\amalg_{s, U, t} R$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-representable}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0c8132c9f92743d27c7b241c414ddf6f6f59d68f1a53ee3d2b5a9f60457d1704", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bcb7d8e2a8a7ec2f931d17348eff618479508b71e616c3502985739d59901431", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. A groupoid in functors on <MATH_0002> is\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>representable<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if it is isomorphic to one of the form\n<MATH_0003> where <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are objects of\n<MATH_0006> and the pushout <MATH_0007> exists.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a318fbc2344c1ec634514f8f5698bcff0d99fd4ec527e6eb6f08cce221df1270", "unit_id": "tag:06K6:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "06K2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$R$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$s, t : U \\to R$", "MATH_0006": "$c : R \\to R \\amalg_{s, U, t} R$", "MATH_0007": "$(\\underline{U}, \\underline{R}, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0008": "$R \\amalg_{s, U, t} R$", "MATH_0009": "$c$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0012": "$\\widehat{\\mathcal{C}}_\\Lambda$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-groupoid-in-functors}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-CLambdahat-pushouts}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-reason-existence-coproduct}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:304b8830c4e8a40daea1eea99a66f715910349a93aa44a4d3ad0df1f3c3d35c2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:afd7a654b8540eaa70f715a8643fda932d6f50e70d2b60bc9c0796f78031d868", "source_text": "Hence a representable groupoid in functors on <MATH_0001> is given by\nobjects <MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004> and morphisms <MATH_0005> and\n<MATH_0006> such that\n<MATH_0007> satisfies the condition of\nDefinition <REF_0001>. The reason for requiring\nthe existence of the pushout <MATH_0008> is so that the composition\nmorphism <MATH_0009> is defined at the level of morphisms in <MATH_0010>.\nThis requirement will always be satisfied below when we consider\nrepresentable groupoids in functors on\n<MATH_0011>, since by\nLemma <REF_0002>\nthe category <MATH_0012> admits pushouts.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ca585c6ec79c5b35f71c8edc5ee8f0397f155ecf3e557e65de48124f7252d733", "unit_id": "tag:06K7:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "06K2", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\underline{U}, \\underline{R}, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$R$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$s, t : U \\to R$", "MATH_0007": "$R \\amalg_{s, U, t} R$", "MATH_0008": "$c : R \\to R \\amalg_{s, U, t} R$", "MATH_0009": "$(\\underline{U}, \\underline{R}, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-simplify-terminology}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ae191905c09a08c45747b4700d97457acaac717054dddad1723054316060a6f6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ee3cb77f5adced5986a67074fcd74c2b57a69c4b5220406f78df483f77edff7a", "source_text": "We will say ``<TEXTITOPEN_0001>let <MATH_0001> be a\ngroupoid in functors on <MATH_0002><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>'' to mean that we have\na representable groupoid in functors. Thus this means that\n<MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> are objects of <MATH_0005>, there are morphisms\n<MATH_0006>, the pushout <MATH_0007> exists,\nthere is a morphism <MATH_0008>, and\n<MATH_0009> is a\ngroupoid in functors on <MATH_0010>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2456744d06a16c1b8d3276ea5ada63f3848d648cb266d9229df29cf6f550a6d2", "unit_id": "tag:06K8:statement"}
